  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added CFG009 (Warning): supported direct IConfiguration reads now report when their path is unavailable from visible appsettings files. Coverage includes unconditional missing GetRequiredSection reads plus suggestion-gated GetSection followed by Get<T> or Bind and GetConnectionString typos. The rule verifies framework APIs, follows safe same-block receiver assignments and aliases, suppresses local/custom/escaped or otherwise unprovable configuration sources, models .NET 10 JSON section existence, avoids duplicate CFG001 reports, and offers the section-literal fix only for a deterministic near-match.",
